  (section
    (heading "Overview")
    (para "Generate canonical test vectors and reference packets that other language implementations will validate against."))
  (section
    (heading "What This Step Builds")
    (para "Generates canonical test vectors — authoritative JSON files in `canonical/test-vectors/` that encode known inputs, expected HMAC values, and expected packet bytes for cross-language validation by Swift and future implementations."))
